\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {IX}{\ignorespaces Validation-selected settings for Table~\ref {tab:sim_accuracy_risk}. The active coefficients are the L2 weight $\lambda _2$, T1 channel/data weights $(\eta _1,\eta _2)$, T2 joint weight $\eta $, or the perfect-training data weight $\eta _2$. The initial posterior standard deviation is $s_0$; dashes denote deterministic models or no penalty. Posterior means use fan-in-scaled uniform initialization with zero biases, separately from $s_0$; the fixed prior has standard deviation one. These are selected configurations from conditional grids, not an exhaustive or full-factorial search.}}{6}{}\protected@file@percent }
